  <body>
    <main>
    <h1>Banana Oatmeal Pudding Recipe</h1>
    <p>
      Welcome to my (definitely not stolen) recipe for pudding which... i'll be honestly i took from <a href="https://runningonrealfood.com/simple-creamy-banana-oatmeal/#wprm-recipe-container-18408$0">this site</a> alongside the image. it's quite a good recipe and i recommend the site. with care: Energized Tea
    </p>
    <section>
    <h2>Ingredient<!--e-->s</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>1 medium ripe banana</li>
      <li>1/2 cup of oats</li>
      <li>1 tbsp chia seeds</li>
      <li>1/2 tsp cinammon</li>
      <li>pinch sea salt</li>
      <li>1/2 cup of water</li>
      <li>1/2 cup of milk</li>
    </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
    <h2>Instruc<!--c-->tion<!--e-->s</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Add all of the ingredients into a small pot and mix well.</li>
      <li>Cook over medium-low heat, mashing the banana while it cooks.</li>
      <li>Cook for 8-10 minutes until creamy, stirring frequently so it doesn’t burn.</li>
      <li>Scoop into a bowl and enjoy</li>
    </ol>
    </main>
